sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Browser user or staff
    participant Route as Next.js route handler
    participant Contract as DTO/schema validation
    participant Controller as NestJS controller
    participant Guard as Auth, tenant, permission guards
    participant Service as Domain service
    participant Store as Prisma tenant/platform store
    participant Response as Response mapper

    User->>Route: Send request with path, body, cookies, and host
    Route->>Contract: Validate and normalize request shape
    Contract-->>Route: Reject malformed input or continue
    Route->>Controller: Forward server-owned context
    Controller->>Guard: Authenticate and resolve scope
    Guard-->>Controller: Trusted principal and tenant context
    Controller->>Service: Invoke domain operation
    Service->>Store: Read/write through scoped data access
    Store-->>Service: Domain result or typed failure
    Service-->>Controller: Domain result
    Controller->>Response: Map stable API contract
    Response-->>Route: JSON and status code
    Route-->>User: UI data or actionable error state

    Note over Route,Guard: The client may provide input, but never authority over tenant or database selection.